Looking at the situation: I'm in round 4 of 6 with a ticket to sell. My minimum is $134. The current buy offers (B1 at $55, B5 at $100, B8 at $53) are all below my floor. None are acceptable. B5 is the most serious buyer at $100, so I should try to negotiate upward. I'll keep my $150 offer on the board and send B5 a message pushing back while opening the door to a deal closer to my range. I won't accept any current offers.

